bluejetty:00072898:ios.description:
Enjoy our absolutely new 2 in 1 app! Color your screen with beautiful HD wallpapers and customize your device ringtones! It’s a great opportunity for you to give your device a completely fresh look and new sound!
Main features of Ringtones App:
– Ringtones Library – includes more than 1000 unique music ringtones for any taste and mood, sorted into 32 categories with such music genres as: Classical, Electronic, Rock, etc;
– Wallpapers Gallery – includes more than 1500 beautiful HD wallpapers and themes for any taste and mood, sorted into 30 categories, such as: Animals, Music, Nature, etc;
– Audio Recorder – record your own voice, songs or any other sounds you want to create your own ringtones from them;
– Ringtone Maker – create your own ringtone, text tone, voicemail, mail, calendar and reminder alerts from our music ringtones library or your own records from our Audio Recorder!
– My Ringtones – edit your saved ringtones, records, text tones and alerts or listen to them without internet or wifi connection.
Make your device absolutely unique with the help of our app. Add a new sound and fresh look to it.
What you will get with Ringtones App:
– 1000+ unique ringtones library with the cool ringtones for any taste and mood (160 for Free);
– 1500+ HD wallpapers and themes for any taste and color (150 for Free);
– Audio Recorder – allows you to record your own voice, songs or any sounds you want, then create a great ringtones from them.
– Ringtone Maker – allows you to make your own ringtone from our music ringtones library or from your records in Audio Recorder;
– My Ringtones – allows you to edit your saved ringtones or listen to them without internet or wifi connection;
– Daily new ringtones and wallpapers updates;
– No ads!
Note that free version of the app is limited to: 
– 160 Ringtones for free (5 in each category for free);
– 150 Wallpapers for free (5 in each category for free);
– 60 sec records in Audio Recorder.
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Ringtones App Pro” is available.
 Auto-renewable Subscription ”Ringtones App Pro” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by app.
Auto-renewable Subscription “Ringtones App Pro” Includes:
– Daily New Ringtones & Wallpapers;
– Unlock All Ringtones;
– Unlock All Wallpapers;
– Unlimited Ringtone Maker;
– Unlimited Audio Recorder;
The app contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”Ringtones App Pro”:
- Weekly (3,99 US$) with a 3-days for free period
* Subscription price may vary depending on your location.
* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
* Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
* Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account;
* Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.
Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/ringtones-app-privacy/
Terms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/
Requested Access:
Microphone – to record your voice, songs or any other sounds from your device microphone;
Photos – to save wallpapers in your Photos and then set them on your device Home Screen or Lock Screen;

